<title>INDONESIA: Tancho 1996 net rises to 15.53 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Tancho 1996 net rises to 15.53 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			15.53 vs 12.79</p>
<p>    Net sales			 140.54 vs 122.96</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 22.60 vs 17.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   21.71 vs 17.07</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    597 vs   492</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		51.84 vs 42.81</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Tancho Indonesia is a cosmetics makers.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
